   "y": 172,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "guards before every push:\n\u00b7 refuse a gutted or torn store\n\u00b7 refuse the app repo's main/master\n\u00b7 NEVER force-push\n\u00b7 additive union: nodes that other\n  machines pushed always survive",
   "originalText": "guards before every push:\n\u00b7 refuse a gutted or torn store\n\u00b7 refuse the app repo's main/master\n\u00b7 NEVER force-push\n\u00b7 additive union: nodes that other\n  machines pushed always survive",
